      bench slowly.
    showDialogBox: 1
    showAlternatePanels: 0
    alternatePanels: []
  - pageName: Page 65
    pageText: Now, move your eye towards the right and left of the pin using the
      provided slider.
    showDialogBox: 1
    showAlternatePanels: 0
    alternatePanels: []
  - pageName: Page 66
    pageText: You can remove the parallax by dragging the image pin on the optical
      bench slowly.
    showDialogBox: 1
    showAlternatePanels: 0
    alternatePanels: []
  - pageName: Page 67
    pageText: Enter the position of the image needle as observed on the optical bench.
    showDialogBox: 1
    showAlternatePanels: 0
    alternatePanels: []
  - pageName: Page 68
    pageText: We need to correct the index error. But our optical bench is well lubricated
      and calibrated such that the index error is O.
